{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日媒報道，朝鮮10月月29日發射疑似發射彈道導彈。韓國軍方同日表示，朝鮮周四朝東海發射一枚不明飛行物體。</p><p>共同社報道，韓國軍方表示偵測到北韓向東部海域發射不明飛行物，落入海洋。日本防衛省也偵測到，指朝鮮發射的可能是彈道導彈，未有落入日本專屬經濟區。</p><figure><img alt=\"朝鮮國旗：FILE PHOTO: A North Korean flag flies on a mast at the Permanent Mission of North Korea in Geneva October 2, 2014. REUTERS/Denis Balibouse/File Photo\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230328/717325288903544832850641.jpeg/oDvQPjflI3TIMWdeuA-thYiBVwnBadnAyjBfAMowXwA\"/><figcaption>朝鮮國旗：FILE PHOTO: A North Korean flag flies on a mast at the Permanent Mission of North Korea in Geneva October 2, 2014. REUTERS/Denis Balibouse/File Photo</figcaption></figure><p>朝鮮本月12日從平壤一帶朝東海發射數枚彈道飛彈，如今再度發射，疑似是針對韓國近期成功試射極音速飛彈一事展示武力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:01:22.637182+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:41:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:52.681137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:58:29.076469+00:00","content_hash":"a01ec2081177330b13a80e88f658a9633c012bf1034ea3bd141aa049a81ebcbf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}